WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
Hand-data handling.

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.833
Hand-tracking permission is optional.

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:15.676
When a supported practice activity requests it, hand position and motion are processed on the device; the declared hand-tracking purpose states that this data is not stored.

00:00:15.676 --> 00:00:21.084
The current permission service alone does not provide CPR-quality measurements.
